# Generic "Smartwatch Clank experimental soak" cron entry.
#
# One entry, regardless of how many OEM collectors are registered — new
# OEMs become participants via config/registry, not new scheduled tasks
# (spec: the soak framework is global, not per-OEM).
#
# Matches this fleet's existing convention: deployments live under
# /home/deploy/staging/<clank>/ and a deploy/run.sh wrapper reads
# .deployed-id and invokes `docker compose run --rm`. Adjust the path if
# this Clank's staging directory differs.
#
# m h  dom mon dow  command
50 1-23/2 * * *  cd /home/deploy/staging/smartwatch-clank && ./deploy/run.sh >> var/logs/soak-cron.log 2>&1
